      "cooked": "<p>I am facing problem in Item Stock Qty.</p>\n<p>In POS the Qty of an item shown does not match with the Qty of that same item in various stock reports.</p>\n<p>Here are a few screen shots of POS and various stock reports.</p>\n<p><strong>POS</strong><br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/9/1910c9b2ab9ef5f11aaacb0fda96bd81a01a5279.jpeg\" alt=\"_StockInPOS\" data-base62-sha1=\"3zJU5pxqsgYqcVaVGuFsUBhgtFD\" width=\"232\" height=\"213\"></p>\n<p><strong>Stock Ledger</strong><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/2/c2636ecc67a6d1114b896ad2b1370048ac95d38e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/c2636ecc67a6d1114b896ad2b1370048ac95d38e\" title=\"_StockLedger\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/2/c2636ecc67a6d1114b896ad2b1370048ac95d38e_2_690x39.png\" alt=\"_StockLedger\" data-base62-sha1=\"rJDF6QJKbpYyPWHrMrjsj40kWoS\" width=\"690\" height=\"39\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/2/c2636ecc67a6d1114b896ad2b1370048ac95d38e_2_690x39.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/2/c2636ecc67a6d1114b896ad2b1370048ac95d38e_2_1035x58.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/2/c2636ecc67a6d1114b896ad2b1370048ac95d38e_2_1380x78.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F3F2F2\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">_StockLedger</span><span class=\"informations\">1429×82 11.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><strong>Stock Balance</strong><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/0/a0c91fa2499356cb11a7ccc2f6d